{
    "name": "E2E Utils Timers - Scheduler schedule types",
    "description": "End-to-end test for appmixer.utils.timers.SchedulerTrigger - regression cover for the schedule types that are NOT 'Days of Month': Daily, Days of Week and Custom Interval. Each sourceless Scheduler fires immediately at flow start and asserts the shape and the time-of-day of the computed next run.",
    "type": "automation",
    "flow": {
        "496f5f69-f009-49e3-8f24-09c92b93b7d1": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.controls.OnStart",
            "label": "On Start",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 16,
            "source": {},
            "config": {},
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "1d740201-51e0-4b7b-be1b-e822c28bd461": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.timers.SchedulerTrigger",
            "label": "Scheduler daily",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 144,
            "source": {},
            "config": {
                "properties": {
                    "scheduleType": "days",
                    "time": "07:45",
                    "timezone": "GMT",
                    "immediate": true
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "08308601-5fe9-4274-80b4-7efbeaf5c101": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.test.Assert",
            "label": "Assert daily run at 07:45 GMT",
            "x": 272,
            "y": 144,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "1d740201-51e0-4b7b-be1b-e822c28bd461": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "1d740201-51e0-4b7b-be1b-e822c28bd461": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "ref-next-date-daily": {
                                            "variable": "$.1d740201-51e0-4b7b-be1b-e822c28bd461.out.nextDateGMT",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "AND": [
                                            {
                                                "field": "{{{ref-next-date-daily}}}",
                                                "assertion": "regex",
                                                "regex": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T07:45:00\\.000Z$",
                                                "label": "Daily schedule keeps the configured time of day"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "2ff7a6d4-99af-47a9-9b64-d3c0c2b0cb57": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.timers.SchedulerTrigger",
            "label": "Scheduler days of week",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 272,
            "source": {},
            "config": {
                "properties": {
                    "scheduleType": "weeks",
                    "daysOfWeek": [
                        "monday",
                        "thursday"
                    ],
                    "time": "18:20",
                    "timezone": "GMT",
                    "immediate": true
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "459b434b-a3e6-4857-aa1e-b79470f7e6d8": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.test.Assert",
            "label": "Assert weekly run at 18:20 GMT",
            "x": 272,
            "y": 272,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "2ff7a6d4-99af-47a9-9b64-d3c0c2b0cb57": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "2ff7a6d4-99af-47a9-9b64-d3c0c2b0cb57": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "ref-next-date-weekly": {
                                            "variable": "$.2ff7a6d4-99af-47a9-9b64-d3c0c2b0cb57.out.nextDateGMT",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "AND": [
                                            {
                                                "field": "{{{ref-next-date-weekly}}}",
                                                "assertion": "regex",
                                                "regex": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T18:20:00\\.000Z$",
                                                "label": "Days of Week schedule keeps the configured time of day"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "37070e81-d9b3-451a-8443-e23bef038c81": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.timers.SchedulerTrigger",
            "label": "Scheduler custom interval",
            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "source": {},
            "config": {
                "properties": {
                    "scheduleType": "custom",
                    "customIntervalUnit": "hours",
                    "customIntervalValue": 6,
                    "timezone": "GMT",
                    "immediate": true
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "cb806bba-bd65-4275-825d-04f0ad5ad2fd": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.test.Assert",
            "label": "Assert custom interval run",
            "x": 272,
            "y": 400,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "37070e81-d9b3-451a-8443-e23bef038c81": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "37070e81-d9b3-451a-8443-e23bef038c81": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "ref-next-date-custom": {
                                            "variable": "$.37070e81-d9b3-451a-8443-e23bef038c81.out.nextDateGMT",
                                            "functions": []
                                        },
                                        "ref-timezone-custom": {
                                            "variable": "$.37070e81-d9b3-451a-8443-e23bef038c81.out.timezone",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "AND": [
                                            {
                                                "field": "{{{ref-next-date-custom}}}",
                                                "assertion": "regex",
                                                "regex": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}\\.[0-9]{3}Z$",
                                                "label": "Custom interval schedule emits a well-formed next run timestamp"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "field": "{{{ref-timezone-custom}}}",
                                                "assertion": "equal",
                                                "expected": "GMT",
                                                "label": "Scheduler reports the configured timezone"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "b5c20b4a-58c5-4a8c-a9b7-6f3cb4f4ef9f": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.test.AfterAll",
            "label": "After All",
            "x": 480,
            "y": 272,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "496f5f69-f009-49e3-8f24-09c92b93b7d1": [
                        "out"
                    ],
                    "08308601-5fe9-4274-80b4-7efbeaf5c101": [
                        "out"
                    ],
                    "459b434b-a3e6-4857-aa1e-b79470f7e6d8": [
                        "out"
                    ],
                    "cb806bba-bd65-4275-825d-04f0ad5ad2fd": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "properties": {
                    "timeout": 180
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        },
        "7b75f328-d5fb-458f-b237-b5f4825de9d0": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.test.ProcessE2EResults",
            "label": "Process E2E Results",
            "x": 688,
            "y": 272,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "b5c20b4a-58c5-4a8c-a9b7-6f3cb4f4ef9f": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "properties": {},
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "b5c20b4a-58c5-4a8c-a9b7-6f3cb4f4ef9f": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "recipients": {},
                                    "testCase": {},
                                    "result": {
                                        "ref-result-schedule-types": {
                                            "variable": "$.b5c20b4a-58c5-4a8c-a9b7-6f3cb4f4ef9f.out",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "recipients": "test@appmixer.ai",
                                    "testCase": "E2E Utils Timers - Scheduler schedule types",
                                    "result": "{{{ref-result-schedule-types}}}"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": false,
                "onError": "stopFlow"
            }
        }
    },
    "notes": {
        "fbfc3251-1a40-4a69-a11a-6bf720a58fea": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 512,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ How this flow fires\n\nThe three Scheduler triggers are **sourceless** and all carry `Trigger immediately = true`, so each emits one payload with the computed `Next Date GMT` at flow start and the flow finishes in seconds instead of waiting for the real schedule.\n\n**Do not turn `Trigger immediately` off** — the triggers would emit nothing and the flow would hang until the AfterAll timeout.\n\nThis flow is the companion of *E2E Utils Timers - Scheduler days of month*: it guards the Daily / Days of Week / Custom Interval branches of `getNextRun()` that the Days of Month fix (issue #2846) sits next to. Assertions are date-independent — they check the shape of the timestamp and the configured time of day, never a specific date.\n\nNo account and no tenant data are required."
        }
    }
}
